<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" version="2.0"><channel><title>彭博社 实时热点</title><link>https://feeds.bloomberg.com/markets/news.rss</link><description>彭博社 自动中文翻译源</description><docs>http://www.rssboard.org/rss-specification</docs><generator>python-feedgen</generator><lastBuildDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 09:00:03 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>加纳回购11亿美元国内债券以提振信心</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/ghana-buys-back-1-1-billion-domestic-bonds-to-boost-confidence</link><description>加纳提前三个月赎回了四年期国内债券，政府试图增强投资者对经济从债务重组中复苏的信心。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/ghana-buys-back-1-1-billion-domestic-bonds-to-boost-confidence'&gt;加纳回购11亿美元国内债券以提振信心&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Ghana Buys Back $1.1 Billion Domestic Bonds to Boost Confidence&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/ghana-buys-back-1-1-billion-domestic-bonds-to-boost-confidence</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 19:31:46 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>中国银行债利差将创两年多来最大涨幅</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/china-bank-bond-spreads-head-for-biggest-jump-in-over-two-years</link><description>随着一家大型国有企业集团的债务压力波及更广泛的信贷市场，中国银行债券利差正面临 2024 年 9 月以来的最大月度涨幅。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/china-bank-bond-spreads-head-for-biggest-jump-in-over-two-years'&gt;中国银行债利差将创两年多来最大涨幅&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：China Bank Bond Spreads Head for Biggest Jump in Over Two Years&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/china-bank-bond-spreads-head-for-biggest-jump-in-over-two-years</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 08:36:16 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>亚洲股票期货信号上涨，油价再次上涨：市场结束</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/asian-stock-futures-signal-gains-oil-climbs-again-markets-wrap</link><description>周四，亚洲股市可能会在科技股上涨的基础上推动美国股指期货上涨，风险偏好复苏的迹象提振了包括铜和比特币在内的资产。也门胡塞武装袭击了沙特一家重要炼油厂后，油价上涨。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/asian-stock-futures-signal-gains-oil-climbs-again-markets-wrap'&gt;亚洲股票期货信号上涨，油价再次上涨：市场结束&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：US Futures Rally as Tech Rebound Gains Momentum: Markets Wrap&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/asian-stock-futures-signal-gains-oil-climbs-again-markets-wrap</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 21:59:57 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>欧元今年兑人民币汇率将出现二十年来最大跌幅</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/euro-set-for-biggest-drop-in-two-decades-against-yuan-this-year</link><description>欧元兑人民币汇率将出现二十年来最大年度跌幅，欧洲官员呼吁中国让人民币进一步升值，以抑制进口激增。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/euro-set-for-biggest-drop-in-two-decades-against-yuan-this-year'&gt;欧元今年兑人民币汇率将出现二十年来最大跌幅&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Euro Set for Biggest Annual Drop Against Yuan in Two Decades&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/euro-set-for-biggest-drop-in-two-decades-against-yuan-this-year</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 23:00:00 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>迪拜股市消除战时损失，成为海湾地区表现最佳的股票</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/dubai-stocks-erase-wartime-losses-to-become-a-top-gulf-performer</link><description>在政府支持和弹性经济活动的推动下，迪拜股市已经抹去了自伊朗战争开始以来的所有损失，从海湾地区最大的落后股市转变为表现最好的股市之一。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/dubai-stocks-erase-wartime-losses-to-become-a-top-gulf-performer'&gt;迪拜股市消除战时损失，成为海湾地区表现最佳的股票&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Dubai Stocks Erase Wartime Losses to Become a Top Gulf Performer&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/dubai-stocks-erase-wartime-losses-to-become-a-top-gulf-performer</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 08:43:08 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>